lved","note":"群體、官稱、對話指代或未名者保留；當前與引語回敘秦王不預接，爭太子不作已授太子，大業不先定祖名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m023-0522","start":522,"end":523,"surface":"王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、官稱、對話指代或未名者保留；當前與引語回敘秦王不預接，爭太子不作已授太子，大業不先定祖名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m023-0528","start":528,"end":530,"surface":"韓王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002647","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m023-0567","start":567,"end":570,"surface":"太子倉","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002648","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-045-han","book_id":"b-shiji-045","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-045-han"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:p024","text":"二十一年，與秦共攻楚，敗楚將屈丐，斬首八萬於丹陽。是歳，宣惠王卒，太子倉立，是爲襄王。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m024-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"屈丐","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002694","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m024-0028","start":28,"end":31,"surface":"宣惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002647","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m024-0033","start":33,"end":36,"surface":"太子倉","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002648","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m024-0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"襄王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002648","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-045-han","book_id":"b-shiji-045","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-045-han"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:p025","text":"襄王四年，與秦武王會臨晉。其秋，秦使甘茂攻我宜陽。五年，秦拔我宜陽，斬首六萬。秦武王卒。六年，秦復與我武遂。九年，秦復取我武遂。十年，太子嬰朝秦而歸。十一年，秦伐我，取穰。與秦伐楚，敗楚將唐眛。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m025-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"襄王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002648","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m025-0006","start":6,"end":9,"surface":"秦武王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002649","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m025-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"甘茂","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002695","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m025-0039","start":39,"end":42,"surface":"秦武王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002649","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m025-0067","start":67,"end":70,"surface":"太子嬰","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002650","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m025-0094","start":94,"end":96,"surface":"唐眛","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002696","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-045-han","book_id":"b-shiji-045","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-045-han"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:p029","text":"十四年，與齊、魏王共撃秦，至函谷而軍焉。十六年，秦與我河外及武遂。襄王卒，太子咎立，是爲釐王。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m029-0005","start":5,"end":9,"surface":"齊、魏王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、官稱、對話指代或未名者保留；當前與引語回敘秦王不預接，爭太子不作已授太子，大業不先定祖名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m029-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"襄王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002648","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m029-0037","start":37,"end":40,"surface":"太子咎","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002651","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m029-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"釐王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002651","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-045-han","book_id":"b-shiji-045","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-045-han"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-045-han","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-045","source_id":"s-shiji-045-han","source":{"title":"史記／卷045","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷045","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷045&oldid=7903607","revision_id":7903607,"accessed_on":"2026-10-09","extent":"36段正文